### E-Commerce API - Week 1 Core CRUD Requests
### Test with VS Code REST Client or Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root / Health Check (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Create Product (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "75% compact keyboard with Bluetooth 5.0",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stock": 15
}

### 3. Create Product - Validation Failure (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing name and price"
}

### 4. Get All Products with Pagination (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 5. Get Single Product by ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 6. Get Non-existent Product (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/9999

### 7. Update Product (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 79.99,
  "stock": 20
}

### 8. Delete Product (200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1
